      story: "The gift framing is doing real work here and it is worth understanding rather than just repeating. Most December giving is people looking for a way to mark the year that is not another object. A membership in someone else's name is that, and it is one of the few asks where the listener gets to be generous twice. \n\nEmancipatory media is the other half of the theme, and it is the part that separates us from every other year-end appeal in their inbox. Independent, listener funded, no advertiser deciding what can be said. That is not a slogan at WPFW, it is the operating condition."
