      detail: "Guests are not agents of Pacifica, which is why they have room that you do not. You may give who they are, what they do, what they made, where and when it can be seen, and their website or phone \u2014 in non-promotional language, under thirty seconds, three times per hour at most.\n\nThe test is consideration. No tickets, no tabling, no performing at a WPFW event for an honorarium rather than a full fee \u2014 when absolutely nothing has been given to the station, this is what the artist may do.\n\nThe moment any consideration has changed hands, this stops and the ticket-giveaway rules take over instead.\n\nPromotional language is still out, even with no consideration. \u201cCome out, it is going to be great\u201d is a pitch, not a fact. Where and when is a fact.",
