      detail: "Consideration is the hinge that everything else turns on. Once something of value has been given, ordinary conversation about the giver becomes promotional language, and promotional language after a consideration is plugola.\n\nThe examples Pacifica uses are free or reduced-price tickets, tabling at an event, and an artist performing at a WPFW event for an honorarium rather than their full fee.\n\nBrad\u2019s compliance training put the simplest version of this: the easy way to keep the station safe is not to accept considerations at all. That is not always the right call \u2014 sometimes the tickets are worth having \u2014 but it should be a decision somebody makes on purpose, not a favor accepted at the studio door.",
