      a: "No. No food and no drink in the studio, water included \u2014 another condition of the building lease rather than a WPFW rule.",
      detail: "Eat, drink and take your breaks outside the room. The Guidebook is blunt about why the breaks matter: a tired host makes expensive mistakes, so take them \u2014 just not at the board.\n\nThe first aid kit and the fire extinguishers are in the kitchen area, which is also where you should be if you are having your coffee.",
      rule: "WPFW building lease; restated in the WPFW Programmer Studio Guidebook v1.0, August 2026, \u00a7\u00a7 2.7 and 7.2"
